Description: Toolset for performance analysis of large-scale parallel applications (intel + impi, OpenHPC)
 Scalasca is a software tool that supports the performance optimization of
 parallel programs by measuring and analyzing their runtime behavior.
 Built with the intel compiler family and impi MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
